GPU inference: specialized GPU node pools (AKS GPU nodes) or Azure Machine Learning managed endpoints that provision GPU compute.
Networking & Security
All components inside a corporate VNet with subnets.
Private endpoints for Storage, Key Vault, ACR, Azure SQL, CosmosDB.
Azure Firewall / NVA + NSGs for traffic control.
Identity: Managed identities + Azure AD RBAC; Key Vault for secrets.
Monitoring & Observability
Azure Monitor + Log Analytics + Application Insights for infra & endpoint latency/errors.
Custom telemetry: model input/out distributions, drift detection metrics, GPU utilization, throughput.
Alerts & runbook automation.
Cost & Governance
Use spot/preemptible nodes for non-critical training.
Auto-shutdown schedules for dev clusters.
Azure Policy for compliance, tagging, allowed SKUs.
Example flow
Data arrives → ETL (Data Factory) → features persisted → model training run via Azure ML job → model registered → CI tests run (unit + model quality) → container built and pushed to ACR → staged on AKS via Helm or Azure ML endpoint → shadow traffic validation → promote to production endpoint.

