6) Additional ML/GenAI production concerns (short bullets)

Model validation & drift detection: automated pipelines that compute label-ready metrics, data drift (population stability index), and trigger retraining if thresholds exceeded.
Shadowing / canary: send % of traffic to new model in prod to compare metrics before full promotion.
Rollback: maintain previous model images and Kubernetes deployment manifests; use rollout strategies (K8s kubectl rollout undo), or swap Azure ML endpoint deployment slots.
Logging & privacy: PII masking in logs; use data anonymization; ensure compliance (GDPR).
Cost optimizations: scheduled scaling, spot nodes for training, separate dev & prod resource quotas.